{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_02822","headline":"宴梓州南亭得池字 · 卢照邻","name":"宴梓州南亭得池字","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"二条开胜迹，大隐叶冲规。\n亭阁分危岫，楼台遶曲池。\n长薄秋烟起，飞梁古蔓垂。\n水鸟翻荷叶，山虫咬桂枝。\n游人惜将晚，公子爱忘疲。\n愿得回三舍，琴尊长若斯。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"卢照邻","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_02822.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_02822","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}